      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64539604525506560
    m_Localized: Press anywhere to continue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69299633465135104
    m_Localized: BUY FREE SPINS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69299633490300928
    m_Localized: BUY SUPER FREE SPINS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69304683977576458
    m_Localized: 'Misuse or malfunction voids all pays and plays.

      Any visual
      representation of a physical device (a reel, a wheel of fortune or similar)
      does not represent a "real" physical device and the probabilities of it stopping
      on any particular position is determined by the game''s random number generator,
      and not the number of positions on each device.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69304683977576457
    m_Localized: The allowed bet levels for this game are between {0} and {1}. Feature
      buys can exceed this limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5660189767302643779
  - m_Id: 69304683977576456
    m_Localized: The RTP of the game when using the "EXTRA BET" is {0}%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5660189767302643779
  - m_Id: 69304683977576455
    m_Localized: The RTP of the game when using "{0}" is {1}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5660189767302643779
  - m_Id: 69304683977576454
    m_Localized: The symbol payouts displayed above reflect the currently selected
      bet level. The theoretical payout for this game is {0}%. The RTP was calculated
      by simulating 10,000,000,000 rounds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5660189767302643779
  - m_Id: 69304683977576453
    m_Localized: 'All wins are multiplied by base bet.

      All values are expressed
      as actual wins in coins.

      When winning with multiple symbols, all wins
      are added to the total win.

      Free spins win is awarded to the player
      after the round completes.

      Free spins total win in the history contains
      the whole win of the cycle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69304683977576452
    m_Localized: General terms and conditions
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69304683977576451
    m_Localized: "All game rounds may be reviewed in History.\nAny amount wagered
      on an unfinished game will remain paused until you either complete the game
      or the game is void as a result of account inactivity or system maintenance.
      \nAny awards earned on an unfinished round will not be credited.\nGame rounds
      will never be affected by unforeseen external errors due to hardware, bandwidth,
      network errors or similar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69304683977576450
    m_Localized: Interrupted game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 69304683977576449
    m_Localized: 'Click to start at the current Bet.

      Click the button or the
      game area during a spin stop to stop the reels.

      Click during a spin
      to stop the normal Spin or Auto Spin. The number on the button indicates the
      remaining Auto Spins.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
